@page "/"

<PageTitle>CryptoViz - Asosiy Oyna</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Large" Class="mt-8">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h3" Align="Align.Center" GutterBottom="true" Color="Color.Primary">Kriptografik Vizuallashtirish</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Align="Align.Center" Class="mb-12">
        ElGamal va Elliptik Egri Chiziqqa Asoslangan ElGamal (EC-ElGamal) algoritmlarini interaktiv o'rganish muhiti.
    </MudText>

    <MudGrid>
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
            <MudCard Elevation="4" Class="pa-4" Style="height: 100%;">
                <MudCardHeader>
                    <CardHeaderContent>
                        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Color="Color.Success">Standard ElGamal</MudText>
                    </CardHeaderContent>
                    <CardHeaderActions>
                        <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Calculate" Color="Color.Success" Size="Size.Large" />
                    </CardHeaderActions>
                </MudCardHeader>
                <MudCardContent>
                    <MudText>
                        Chekli maydonlar (Finite Fields) va diskret logarifmlash muammosi asosida ishlovchi klassik assimetrik kriptografik algoritm. Bu yerda siz modulli arifmetikani qadamma-qadam ko'rishingiz mumkin.
                    </MudText>
                </MudCardContent>
                <MudCardActions>
                    <MudButton Href="/elgamal" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Success" FullWidth="true">Boshlash</MudButton>
                </MudCardActions>
            </MudCard>
        </MudItem>
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
            <MudCard Elevation="4" Class="pa-4" Style="height: 100%;">
                <MudCardHeader>
                    <CardHeaderContent>
                        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Color="Color.Secondary">EC-ElGamal</MudText>
                    </CardHeaderContent>
                    <CardHeaderActions>
                        <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ShowChart" Color="Color.Secondary" Size="Size.Large" />
                    </CardHeaderActions>
                </MudCardHeader>
                <MudCardContent>
                    <MudText>
                        Elliptik egri chiziq nuqtalari ustida ishlovchi (Elliptic Curve Cryptography) zamonaviy va kuchli shifrlash usuli. Bitcoin va ko'plab zamonaviy tizimlar asosini tashkil etadi.
                    </MudText>
                </MudCardContent>
                <MudCardActions>
                    <MudButton Href="/ec-elgamal" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Secondary" FullWidth="true">Boshlash</MudButton>
                </MudCardActions>
            </MudCard>
        </MudItem>
    </MudGrid>
</MudContainer>
